# Baileys 7.0.0-rc13 — newsletter media upload path
#
# Upstream bug: WhiskeySockets/Baileys#2199. Newsletter media is uploaded to the
# ordinary /mms/* endpoints, so WhatsApp returns an /o1/ directPath instead of
# /m1/ and the media never renders in the channel.
#
# Source: https://github.com/yonatann/Baileys-1/commit/777a173
#
# STATUS: applying this does yield the correct /m1/ directPath — verified — but
# channel media is STILL rejected by WhatsApp with smax-invalid (479). So this
# is necessary but not sufficient. Kept so the work is not lost.
#
# NOT APPLIED: this repo has no patch-package. To use it, add patch-package with
# a postinstall hook, or move to a fork that already carries the fix.

